              "aws_devops.run_supplied_unit_and_integration_tests_as_blocking_pipeline_gates#tb5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "text": "Leave continue-on-error unset on blocking test steps. In the supplied failure case, promotion is skipped even though the other test succeeds. Tolerating that failure would defeat the blocking gate.",
